Urban Digital Twin - RAG corpus

Drop SOPs, escalation matrices, shelter registers and past sitreps here as
.md, .txt or .json files. twin/agent/rag.py indexes every file in this
directory (and its subdirectories) and cites the most relevant passages in
agent-drafted briefs.

This file is named README with no extension deliberately, so it is never
itself picked up and cited as a corpus document - retrieve() only reads
files ending in .md, .txt or .json.

Empty by default. With nothing here, briefs simply carry no citations - an
honestly-empty list, not a wrong one - rather than the agent inventing a
source that does not exist.
